# NopsAI Product Wiki Source Map

This document is the repository-side source map for the in-app product wiki at
`services/ui/src/pages/ProductDocs.tsx` and its data model at
`services/ui/src/features/product-docs/model.ts`.

The wiki is intentionally grounded in the current repository implementation. It
should not describe future-state infrastructure, storage, autoscaling, or
cloud-specific automation unless that capability is backed by runtime code,
deployment files, tests, and focused docs.

The in-app wiki must be usable as a field reference. A user who sees
`llm_profile` under a step, `dashboard.mode` under an output item, or
`allowed_callers` under an external trigger should be able to search that exact
directive and learn what it does, where it can be used, what it does not grant,
and which options are currently supported.

## Source Priority

Use this order when updating product documentation:

1. Runtime code, schemas, and route behavior.
2. Docker Compose and Helm deployment files.
3. Focused markdown under `doc/`.
4. Root README examples.
5. UI help text only when it agrees with implementation.

